1
00:00:00,872 --> 00:00:02,452
(Leonard:)Could you tell us?

2
00:00:03,041 --> 00:00:04,961
(Sheldon:)Let's see.

3
00:00:06,503 --> 00:00:08,543
(Sheldon:)Snake eyes. Sorry, bud.

4
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:12,470
(Penny:)Wait. Hang on. Doubles. Roll again.

5
00:00:16,263 --> 00:00:18,303
(Sheldon:)Okay, get this.

6
00:00:19,391 --> 00:00:21,471
(Sheldon:)It doesn't matter
if he's showering her with gifts...

7
00:00:21,643 --> 00:00:24,523
(Sheldon:)...because the Koothrappalis
are vastly weaIthy.

8
00:00:25,647 --> 00:00:29,397
- What do you mean "vastly weaIthy"?
- Well, "weaIthy" means a lot of money.

9
00:00:29,568 --> 00:00:32,608
"Vastly" means even more.
I'm not sure what's tripping you up.

10
00:00:33,488 --> 00:00:35,948
(Leonard:)I know they have money.
I don't think it's that much.

11
00:00:36,116 --> 00:00:38,826
(Sheldon:)No, you're wrong.
As you know, a few years ago...

12
00:00:38,994 --> 00:00:42,584
(Sheldon:)...I achieved one of my lesser dreams
and became a notary public.

13
00:00:42,748 --> 00:00:47,458
(Sheldon:)Well, from time to time,
I notarize banking documents for Raj.

14
00:00:47,627 --> 00:00:53,027
(Sheldon:)The Koothrappalis aren't just rich,
they're Richie Rich rich.

